<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n108478" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποκαθ-ίζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>place in ambush,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λόχον ἐν ὕλαις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					9.56
				</span></i>
			:—
				Med.
			, <i>lie in ambush,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑ. ὑπὸ τῷ τείχει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>HG</u>
					7.2.5
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> intr. in 
				Act.
			, <i>lie in ambush,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				12.4.14
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>sink down, form a sediment,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				13.285
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Placit.</u>
				1.4.2
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>sit down under,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὡς . . ἐκ τῆς σκιᾶς</span> (sc.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς σμίλακος</span>)
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc"> τοὺς ὑποκαθίσαντας . . βλάπτεσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dsc.
					4.79
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
